datory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10274","internal_name":"PUR_3","title":"Is this a Gift/Award request?","group":"Internal Info","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"DropdownList","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10254","internal_name":"PUR_4","title":"Will food be delivered to event by Supplier? (Only approved caterers can deliver to campus)","group":"Internal Info","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"DropdownList","mandatory":"Sì","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10270","internal_name":"FAR_1","title":"Does this request include the purchase or serving of alcohol?","group":"Internal Info","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"DropdownList","mandatory":"Sì","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10298","internal_name":"Delivery/Pick-Up Date (if applicable)","title":"","group":"Internal Info","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"Date","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"113","internal_name":null,"title":null,"group":"Internal Info","element_type":"static","field_type":null,"mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]}]},{"path":"campi-4","title":"Campi — Transaction Details","level":1,"page":null,"paragraphs":[],"tables":[{"caption":"campi","headers":["Nome tecnico","Campo","Tipo","Obbligatorio","Gruppo","Sola lettura","Lunghezza massima","Convalide","Note"],"rows":[["Event Tracking Info","","HTML","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=<TABLE WIDTH = \"900\" HEIGHT = \"35\" ALIGN = \"center\" BGCOLOR = \"#F0F8FF\" CELLPADDING = \"10\" BORDER= \"1\" BORDER-STYLE = \"ridge\"> <TBODY><TR><TD><Font Color = \"BLACK\" SIZE = \"3\"><B><CENTER>Expense Tracking Information</Font Color = \"BLACK\" SIZE = \"3\"></B></CENTER><P><P> An <B>Expense Tracking Number </B>is required if multiple funding transactions are used for a meal’s expenses (a requisition combined with at least one additional requisition, recharge, or reimbursement). The Expense Tracking Number is used to accurately monitor the per-person cost for any meals included in the event. The same Expense Tracking Number must be used on each transaction associated with a particular meal.<P> The <B>Expense Tracking Number </B>can be: <UL><LI>The number of the first requisition submitted for the meal (recommended if all meal expenses are orders)<CENTER><B>OR</B></CENTER> <LI>The ERF number if there are reimbursements or recharges associated with the meal <CENTER><B>OR</B></CENTER> <LI>The Meal Expense Tracker (MET) form number if you are using a MET for your event.</LI></UL> The ERF and MET forms are accessed on the Entertainment section of the Financial Affairs Dashboard. Sign in with your Gold password. </TD> </TR> </TBODY> </TABLE> <P><P><P><P> · id=10313 · tipo=userdefined"],["Expense Tracking Number","","TextBox","Sì","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxSize=20; UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxMaxLength=20 · id=10308 · tipo=userdefined"],["Tracking Number Instructions","","HTML","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=Enter zero<B> \"0\" </B>if all expenses for the meal are<BR> included on a single requisition, or if order is for Bulk food, Gift or Ticket purchase.<P><P> · id=10315 · tipo=userdefined"],["Top-Level Determination 2","","HTML","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=<P><P><P><P><TABLE WIDTH = \"900\" HEIGHT = \"35\" ALIGN = \"center\" BGCOLOR = \"#F0F8FF\" CELLPADDING = \"10\" BORDER= \"1\" BORDER-STYLE = \"ridge\"> <TBODY><TR><TD> <B><CENTER><FONT SIZE=\"3\">Top Level Determination</CENTER></FONT Size =\"3\"></B><P><P><B> Events requiring top level approval </B>(see determination list directly below) <B>must</B> have the <B>approval included </B>in comments or an email attachment referencing the <B>event name or brief description</B>, the <B>event date</B> and the <B>estimated total cost.</B></P><P><P><UL> <LI> Purchase or serving of alcohol; <LI> Exceeding the per-person meal cost <A HREF=\"https://sciquest.com\" TARGET=\"_BLANK\">(Per-Person Meal Limits)</A>; <LI> Meals provided to a spouse, domestic partner, or family member of host/guest;<LI> Event where cash contributions are included in the cost;<LI> Meals provided to employees as part of a morale-building activity, including retirement and recognition receptions, etc.;<LI> Tickets provided to prospective donors, employees, or student appointees in connection with an entertainment event.</LI><P></UL> </FONT> </TD> </TR> </TBODY> </TABLE><P><P><P> · id=10311 · tipo=userdefined"],["Top Level Question","Does this F&E order event require Top-Level approval? (See Top-Level determination list above)","DropdownList","Sì","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamFormListId=248384 · id=10297 · tipo=userdefined"],["Per Person Costs","","HTML","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=<P><P><P><TABLE WIDTH = \"900\" HEIGHT = \"35\" ALIGN = \"center\" BGCOLOR = \"#F0F8FF\" CELLPADDING = \"10\" BORDER= \"1\" BORDER-STYLE = \"ridge\"> <TBODY><TR><TD><CENTER><B><FONT Size =\"3\">Per-Person Meal Costs</FONT Size =\"3\"></B></CENTER><P><P> The per-person meal cost is calculated by dividing the <B>TOTAL</B> cost of the meal by the number of meal attendees. If there are <B>multiple requisitions (or multiple line items on a single requisition), reimbursements or recharges</B> containing costs for a single meal, be sure to use the <B>sum of all costs</B> pertaining to each individual meal in the per-person meal cost calculation, not just the amount being submitted on this requisition line item.<P><P>The Meal Expense Tracker accessed through the <B><U><A HREF=\"https://sciquest.com\" target=\"_blank\">Financial Affairs Dashboard</A></u></B> provides per-person cost calculations </B></U> for your convenience. Sign in to the Meal Expense Tracker with your gold password. </FONT> </TD> </TR> </TBODY> </TABLE><P><P><P> · id=10309 · tipo=userdefined"],["Meal Type","","DropdownList","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamFormListId=248385 · id=10291 · tipo=userdefined"],["Per Person Cost","Per-Person Meal Cost?","TextBox","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxSize=40; UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxMaxLength=40 · id=10292 · tipo=userdefined"],["ContractStartDate","Event Date","Date","No","","false","","","id=10009 · tipo=userdefined"],["Event Location","","TextBox","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxSize=40; UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxMaxLength=50 · id=10256 · tipo=userdefined"],["Event Purpose/Justification","","TextBox","No","","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxSize=60; UserDefinedFieldParamTextBoxMaxLength=1000 · id=10279 · tipo=userdefined"]]}],"figures":[],"kind":"config-export","records":[{"kind":"element","name":"10313","internal_name":"Event Tracking Info","title":"","group":"Basic F&E Requirements","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"HTML","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10308","internal_name":"Expense Tracking Number","title":"","group":"Basic F&E Requirements","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"TextBox","mandatory":"Sì","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10315","internal_name":"Tracking Number Instructions","title":"","group":"Basic F&E Requirements","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"HTML","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10311","internal_name":"Top-Level Determination 2","title":"","group":"Basic F&E Requirements","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"HTML","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]},{"kind":"element","name":"10297","internal_name":"Top Level Question","title":"Does this F&E order event requ